#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:58
msgid "Semantic & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:59
msgid ""
"Cal.com is deliberately colorless for brand elements — \"a grayscale "
"brand to emphasise on boldness and professionalism\""
