msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:70
msgid ""
"**Display**: `Cal Sans` — custom geometric sans-serif by Mark Davis. "
"Open-source, available on Google Fonts and GitHub. Extremely tight "
"default letter-spacing designed for large headlines. Has 6 character "
"variants (Cc, j, t, u, 0, 1)"
msgstr ""

