#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:97
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:98
msgid ""
"**Cal Sans at large, Inter at small**: Cal Sans is exclusively for "
"headings and display — never for body text. The system enforces this "
"division strictly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:99
msgid ""
"**Tight by default, space when small**: Cal Sans letters are "
"\"intentionally spaced to be extremely close\" at large sizes. At 20px "
"and below, positive letter-spacing (+0.2px) must be applied to prevent "
"cramming"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:100
msgid ""
"**Weight 300 body variant**: Cal Sans UI Variable Light at 300 weight "
"creates an elegant, airy body text that contrasts with the dense "
"600-weight headlines"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:101
msgid ""
"**Weight 600 dominance**: Nearly all Cal Sans usage is at weight 600 "
"(semi-bold) — the font was designed to perform at this weight"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:102
msgid ""
"**Negative tracking on light text**: Cal Sans UI Light uses -0.2px to "
"-0.28px letter-spacing, subtly tightening the already-compact letterforms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:104
msgid "4. Component Stylings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:106
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:107
msgid ""
"**Dark Primary**: `#242424` (or `#1e1f23`) background, white text, 6–8px "
"radius. Hover: opacity reduction to 0.7. The signature CTA — maximally "
"dark on white"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:108
msgid ""
"**White/Ghost**: White background with shadow-ring border, dark text. "
"Uses the multi-layered shadow system for subtle elevation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:109
msgid "**Pill**: 9999px radius for rounded pill-shaped actions and badges"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:110
msgid "**Compact**: 4px padding, small text — utility actions within product UI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:111
msgid ""
"**Inset highlight**: Some buttons feature `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 0px "
"2px 0px inset` — a subtle inner-top highlight creating a 3D pressed "
"effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:113
msgid "Cards & Containers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:114
msgid ""
"**Shadow Card**: White background, multi-layered shadow — `rgba(19, 19, "
"22, 0.7) 0px 1px 5px -4px, rgba(34, 42, 53, 0.08) 0px 0px 0px 1px, "
"rgba(34, 42, 53, 0.05) 0px 4px 8px 0px`. The ring shadow (0px 0px 0px "
"1px) acts as a shadow-border"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:115
msgid ""
"**Product UI Cards**: Screenshots of the scheduling interface displayed "
"in card containers with shadow elevation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:116
msgid ""
"**Radius**: 8px for standard cards, 12px for larger containers, 16px for "
"prominent sections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:117
msgid "**Hover**: Likely subtle shadow deepening or scale transform"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:119
msgid "Inputs & Forms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:120
msgid ""
"**Select dropdown**: White background, `#000000` text, 1px solid "
