#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:195
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:197
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:198
msgid ""
"Use Cal Sans exclusively for headings (24px+) and never for body text — "
"it's a display font with tight default spacing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:199
msgid ""
"Apply positive letter-spacing (+0.2px) when using Cal Sans below 24px — "
"the font cramps at small sizes without it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:200
msgid "Maintain the grayscale palette — boldness comes from contrast, not color"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:201
msgid ""
"Use the multi-layered shadow system for card elevation — ring shadow + "
"diffused shadow + contact shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:202
msgid ""
"Keep backgrounds pure white — the monochrome philosophy requires a clean "
"canvas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:203
msgid ""
"Use Inter for all body text at weight 300–600 — it's the reliable "
"counterpart to Cal Sans's display personality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:204
msgid ""
"Let product screenshots be the visual content — no illustrations, no "
"decorative graphics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:205
msgid ""
"Apply generous section spacing (80px–96px) — the breathing room is "
"essential to the premium feel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:207
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:208
msgid ""
"Use Cal Sans for body text or text below 16px — it wasn't designed for "
"extended reading"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:209
msgid ""
"Add brand colors — Cal.com is intentionally grayscale, color is reserved "
"for links and UI states only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:210
msgid ""
"Use CSS borders when shadows can achieve the same containment — the ring-"
"shadow technique is the system's approach"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:211
msgid ""
"Apply negative letter-spacing to Cal Sans at small sizes — it needs "
"positive spacing (+0.2px) below 24px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:212
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Create heavy, dark shadows — Cal.com's shadows are subtle (5% opacity "
"diffused) with sharp contact edges"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:213
msgid ""
"Use illustrations, abstract graphics, or decorative elements — the visual"
" language is typography + product UI only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:214
msgid ""
"Mix Cal Sans weights — the font is designed for weight 600, other weights"
" break the intended character"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cal.md:215
msgid ""
"Reduce section spacing below 48px — the generous whitespace is core to "
"the premium monochrome aesthetic"
msgstr ""

